From: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] cert_create: include key algorithm headers

OpenSSL 3.0 declares the EVP RSA and EC key generation helpers in the
algorithm-specific headers. Include them explicitly instead of relying on
indirect includes from newer OpenSSL releases.

Signed-off-by: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>
---
 tools/cert_create/src/key.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

--- a/tools/cert_create/src/key.c
+++ b/tools/cert_create/src/key.c
@@ -10,8 +10,10 @@
 #include <string.h>
 
 #include <openssl/conf.h>
+#include <openssl/ec.h>
 #include <openssl/evp.h>
 #include <openssl/pem.h>
+#include <openssl/rsa.h>
 
 #include "cert.h"
 #include "cmd_opt.h"
